+	// maxExemplarTime is the highest timestamp among the exemplars accepted for
+	// this series. hasExemplar records whether any exemplar was accepted; a
+	// separate flag is needed because zero and negative timestamps are valid.
+	// Together they let head GC keep the series identity while an exemplar is
